    "title": "Cowboy Valley: Idle RPG Texas",
    "description": "Outlaws stole you precious pet Daisy and blew up the ranch. Chase the bandits through spectacular biomes, bring them to justice and retrieve the precious piggy! Restore the ranch and fill it with all sorts of cattle you catch along the way!\r\n\r\n- DEVELOP the business and UPGRADE the ranch.\r\n- HERD and PROTECT the cattle in the inhospitable old west environment.   \r\n- Master your LASSO and SHOOTING skills.  \r\n- Catch BANDITS and help sheriff to maintain law and order in the town. \r\n\r\nInstall now and bang bang bang!",
